			<div class="content" id="post-content-1869193">
									

<p><em>Pickiest fucking storms ever.</em> Also, that cast list sounds like the most scientifically-formatted &quot;walks into a bar&quot; joke setup ever.</p>
<p>I love how this is like 80% containment, even in the description. And as wacky as they are, the procedures leave enough out to still be intriguing. Goes to show not everything has to be Montauk to work. I also love that this makes me wonder just how much of that procedure is actually necessary. I mean, did they just start doing the exact same thing or have they tested it at all? Can they even test it, given that failure is generally going to be catastrophic?</p>
<p>My one question: why is &quot;DOCUMENT&quot; in all caps?</p>
<p>Oh, and I feel like this could qualify as Keter, given how much can go wrong in the containment. Begin discussion!</p>

